#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: std-imports
version: 0.1.0
description: Does importing std/http and std/fs still make a program unlowerable?
---
```scalascript
[route, serve](std/http.ssc)
[readFile, exists](std/fs.ssc)

def main(): Unit =
  route("GET", "/", p => "ok")
  println("registered " + exists("/tmp"))
main()
```
